      "p_a_canonical": 0.9991959135410103,
      "prose": {
        "text": "Keep the programme.\n\nThe programme is better off being kept because it saves the city money in the long run, as the avoided landfill charges ($640,000) outweigh the costs of collection ($520,000).",
